<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n7656" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀνα-τρίβω</span></b> 
		<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">[ῑ</span>], <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>rub, chafe,</i>
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τὸν ὦμον</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Hp.
					<u>Art.</u>
					9
				</span></i>
			:—
				Med.
			, <i><span class="en">
				Id.
				<u>Vict.</u>
				3.83
			</span></i>; <i>massage oneself,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				Aristid.
				<u>Or.</u>
				47(23).18
			</span></i>, cf. <i><span class="en">
				50
			</span></i>, al.:—
				Pass.
			, sens. obsc., <i><span class="en">
				Ar.
				<u>Ach.</u>
				1149
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b>
			<i>rub clean,</i>
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">κύνας</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					X.
					<u>Cyn.</u>
					6.26
				</span></i>
			. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>3.</b>
			
				Med.
			, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐλαίῳ ὕδωρ συμμείξας ἀ.</span>”
				<i>rub oneself down,</i>
				 <i><span class="en">
					Arist.
					<u>Pr.</u>
					881a5
				</span></i>
			. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>4.</b>
			
				Pass.
			, <i>to be worn away,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				Hdt.
				3.113
			</span></i>.</div>
